  "description": "Compose Prometheus scrape health. Default stack scrapes the native host router on :11435; do not scrape production :11436. Additive stack dashboard — fleet overview remains home.",
  "editable": false,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    {
      "asDropdown": false,
